{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059230/extras/78741069aa03d2edce4f575f6c034b17.avif?t=1762943326\" width=1232 height=305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of snake parkour! Here, you don\u2019t control an ordinary character\u2014you embody one of nature\u2019s most agile creatures. Your goal is simple: crawl, coil, climb, and overcome challenging courses to reach the top. But remember\u2014success requires not only speed, but also strategy and patience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059230/extras/563a5dfa5fda071a226342f56be64024.avif?t=1762943326\" width=1232 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay is fully physics-based. Control the snake with WASD, and progress by wrapping around or coiling onto obstacles. Each course presents unique challenges: from slippery surfaces and narrow passages to high climbs and balance-focused sections, every level tests your reflexes and skills.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059230/extras/d26ef251c8da626c4cea15c10bcc01ca.avif?t=1762943326\" width=1232 height=294 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic, physics-based snake movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nature-inspired obstacle courses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple strategies and paths to complete levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increasingly challenging stages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable and unique gameplay experiences</strong></p></li></ul>","backgroun